ied key to the end of the access order list to indicate it was recently used.\n\n        Args:\n            key: The key to move.\n        \"\"\"\n        if key in self._cache:\n            self._access_order.remove(key)\n            self._access_order.append(key)\n\n    def _evict_least_recent(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"\n        Remove the least recently used item from the cache to",
